 ients (pts) with relapsed/refractory multiple myeloma (RRMM) and 1–4 pri
 or lines of therapy (LOT)\nPresenter: Paula Rodriguez Otero\, MD\, PhD\nPh
 ase 3 PFS and OS benefit for dual-bispecific therapy in predominantly anti
